    excerpt: "A buying guide specifically for T65, turning-65, Medicare leads and how to convert them effectively.",
    metaDescription: "A buying guide for T65, turning-65 Medicare leads, covering how these age-in prospects differ from other lead types and how to convert them effectively.",
